title: HeatLab — Thermal Physics Scientific Computing Lab
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - name: HeatLab project team
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-08-18"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Interactive thermal-physics visualizations for ideal gas kinetics,
  Brownian motion, Maxwell–Boltzmann speed distribution, and the Galton board,
  with desktop (PySide6) and real-time browser (Flask) front ends.
keywords:
  - thermal physics
  - scientific computing
  - visualization
  - Langevin dynamics
  - Maxwell-Boltzmann
  - Galton board
